---
title: Distance from shops to bike parking
description: Visualize bicycle parking availability by location
type: geojson
popupTemplate: '{% assign desc = properties.name %}<p><b><a href="https://openstreetmap.org/{{ properties.type }}/{{ properties.id }}">{{ properties.name | default: properties.amenity | default: properties.highway }} osm {{ properties.type}}/{{ properties.id }}</a></b> is {{ properties._distance_meters | round: 0 }} from nearest bicycle parking (<a href="https://openstreetmap.org/{{ properties._type_closest }}/{{ properties._id_closest }}">{{properties._type_closest}}/{{properties._id_closest}}</a>).</p><p>{%- for tag in properties %}<code>{{tag[0]}}={{tag[1]}}</code><br/>{% endfor %}</p>'
options:
  zoom: 11.6
  center: [ 43.34, -79.805 ]
style:
  extends: https://styles.trailsta.sh/maptiler-basic.json
  layers:

    - type: circle
      beforeLayerId: road_one_way_arrow
      minzoom: 7

      circle-color:
        - interpolate
        - [linear]
        - [get, "_distance_meters"]
        - 120
        - rgba(0,202,0,255)
        - 240
        - rgb(239,0,9)
        - 600
        - rgb(0,0,0)

      circle-stroke-color: white
      circle-stroke-width: 1
      # Transition from heatmap to circle layer by zoom level
      circle-opacity:
        - interpolate
        - [linear]
        - [zoom]
        - 10
        - 0
        - 13
        - 1
---
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ellieayla/bicycle-parking-distance/refs/heads/main/distance_from_shops_to_nearest_bicycle_parking.geojson